    {
      "source": "<a href=\"ParameterValueProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>ParameterValueProvider</code></a> that can be used to front a <a href=\"ParameterValueProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>ParameterValueProvider</code></a> delegate to prefer a SpEL\nexpression evaluation over directly resolving the parameter value with the delegate.",
      "translation": "一个可用于包装 <a href=\"ParameterValueProvider.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.model 中的接口\"><code>ParameterValueProvider</code></a> 委托的 <a href=\"ParameterValueProvider.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.model 中的接口\"><code>ParameterValueProvider</code></a>，以优先选择 SpEL 表达式求值，而不是直接通过委托解析参数值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"ParameterValueProvider.html#getParameterValue(org.springframework.data.mapping.Parameter)\">ParameterValueProvider</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"ParameterValueProvider.html#getParameterValue(org.springframework.data.mapping.Parameter)\">ParameterValueProvider</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Hook to allow to massage the value resulting from the Spel expression evaluation. Default implementation will\nleverage the configured <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> to massage the value into the parameter type.",
      "translation": "钩子，允许对 Spel 表达式求值后得到的结果进行转换。默认实现将利用配置的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> 将结果转换为参数类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Hook to allow to massage the value resulting from the Spel expression evaluation.",
      "translation": "钩子，允许对 Spel 表达式求算结果值进行修饰。",
      "count": 2
    },
